Subject: [PATCH] llsc cmpxchg fault contract

Keep LL/SC compare-exchange emission and unaligned fault decoding consistent.

Source: local macOS Wine queue; see ../../README.md for ancestry and dependencies.
License: ../LICENSE (MIT)

